  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Move Arch package validation into the release workflow after Linux, and attach the resulting package to tagged releases.\n- Update the tracked AUR recipe to v0.14.0 and let tagged release runs select their own version and archive checksum.\n- Build and package FreeBSD amd64 natively in a FreeBSD VM, with a headless launch check and a portable tarball.\n- Leave Web/WASM unchanged while issue #31 handles the browser UI.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check`, workflow YAML parsing, and `bash -n scripts/package-freebsd.sh` passed locally.\n- Manual GitHub workflow run: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/42499150486 (in progress).\n\nChangelog: none (build and packaging only)\n\nRefs #72\n",
